  "body": "Welcome to 42 John Rymer Place, Kohimarama - a beautifully appointed family home offering space, comfort and versatility in a sought-after location. Designed with family living and entertaining in mind, this impressive residence features five generous bedrooms, three bathrooms and three separate living areas, providing plenty of room for growing families, guests and those seeking flexible living options. The modern kitchen is the heart of the home, complemented by a gas fireplace that creates a warm and inviting atmosphere. A ground-level bedroom offers excellent flexibility for guests, extended family or teenagers, while the spacious master bedroom is a true retreat, complete with its own conservatory and private ensuite.\r\n\r\nComfort is assured throughout the seasons with four heat pumps and a DVS ventilation system. Positioned to capture the sun, the north-facing aspect enhances the home's light and warmth, while fully gated grounds provide added privacy, security and peace of mind. Completing the package is a double internal-access garage and an abundance of\r\nspace for the whole family to enjoy. \r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Eastridge Shopping Centre, a very short walk to Selwyn College, St Thomas School and the bus stop, as well as direct street access to the Glen Innes/Tamaki walkway and bicycle track, and an 8 -minute bike ride to Meadowbank Train Station. This home offers an enviable combination of lifestyle, comfort and convenience in the heart of Kohimarama.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n* Five spacious bedrooms\r\n* Three bathrooms\r\n* Three separate living areas\r\n* Ground-level bedroom for added flexibility\r\n* Master bedroom with conservatory and ensuite\r\n* Modern kitchen\r\n* Gas fireplace\r\n* Four heat pumps\r\n* DVS ventilation system\r\n* North-facing aspect\r\n* Fully gated property\r\n* Double garage\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a spacious and versatile family home in one of Auckland's most desirable suburbs.",
